2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]   WHAT : logging.basicConfig(filename=LOG_FN) -> logging.handlers.
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          WatchedFileHandler(LOG_FN). One handler swap in the LOGGING block;
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          added `import logging.handlers`. No engine/strategy code touched.
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]   WHY  : every Nifty & Sensex FlightRecorder *.log had been BOOT-BANNER-ONLY
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          for ~a week (08-20 -> 08-28): 32,891 bytes, last line 8 seconds after
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          boot, while the BarLevel CSV ran to 15:25. push_logs_to_github() runs
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          `git rebase --autostash` every 5 min; with a dirty tree the autostash
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          push/pop deletes and recreates every modified tracked file, including
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          the log being written. The plain FileHandler held its fd on the old
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          inode, so all later lines went to an orphaned inode. This is why the
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          "check the Thursday log" instructions left for EXP2W / EXP12-relax /
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          Upstox were all uncheckable. Real record was ~/orion_*_run.log (stdout).
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]   EVIDENCE : reproduced against a REAL two-bot `git rebase --autostash` cycle
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          (scratchpad/wfhtest/repro3.py): FileHandler -> on-disk log holds ONLY
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          the boot banner (inode swapped mid-run); WatchedFileHandler -> all
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          lines through EOD survive the identical swap. Control that confirms
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          the diagnosis in production: stocks_run.log is NOT git-tracked, is
2026-10-02 03:36:05,021 [INFO]          never touched by the push, and is complete through 15:30 IST on the
